---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TopicList from '../components/TopicList.astro';
import { topics } from '../lib/content';
const all = await topics();
---
<Base title="专题" section="专题"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT EXPLORATIONS</p><h1>专题<span class="count">{all.length}</span></h1></div><p>每一个专题，都有自己的世界。<br />从这里出发，在独立站点继续阅读。</p></div><div class="topics-page"><TopicList entries={all} /></div><p class="end-note">专题在独立站点更新；这里保留通往它们的入口。</p></Base>
